[About]
MegaBall 4 by Ed and Al Mackey - registered version, now under the Apache 2.0 licence.

[Installing]
MegaBall does not run straight from the floppies. Install it to a hard drive:
1. Boot Workbench from a hard drive.
2. Insert disk 1 and run its installer.
3. Insert disks 2 and 3 when asked.

[Emulators]
The authors note that only accurate sound emulation works, because of the sound set-up routines.

